        </p>
        <a href="mailto:developer@stayverse.com" class="btn mt-2 d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 50px; background: white; color: #FF385C; text-decoration: none; border: 1.5px solid #FF385C; font-weight: 600; transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-3px)'; this.style.boxShadow='0 6px 12px rgba(255,56,92,0.2)'; this.style.background='#FF385C'; this.style.color='white';" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)'; this.style.boxShadow='none'; this.style.background='white'; this.style.color='#FF385C';">
